# --- Quartus build artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# Every compile creates these below variants/<name>/.
db/
incremental_db/
greybox_tmp/
atom_netlists/
output_files/
simulation/
*.qws
*.qdf
*.ipregen.rpt
*.pin
*.cdf

# --- Editor / OS / backup ----------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*\ -\ Kopie.*
Thumbs.db
.claude/

# --- Not part of the repository ----------------------------------------------
# Game ROM images (copyrighted) and scanned manual pages. The text derived from
# the scans lives in docs/switch_matrix/ and is checked in.
roms/
ROM/
docs/*.png
docs/*.jpg
docs/*.jpeg

# FPGA flash images WITH game ROMs (HAS_FLASH_ROM, scripts/make_flash_hex.ps1). They
# may sit next to the release files in bin/ for local use, but never go to GitHub.
*_roms.jic
*_roms.hex

# NOTE: archive/ holds lib_archive (historic module versions) and IS tracked.
# NOTE: rtl/common/cmos_256_0Fh.hex is a source file, not a game ROM.
# NOTE: variants/*/willfa7.cof is the programming-file converter setup and is
#       tracked, even though it used to live under output_files/.
